            </note>
            <note corresp="#d108-f4" n="85" xml:id="d108-f4-content">
                <p>See telegram No. 190, Apr. 21, 1926, from the Minister in China, <ref
                        target="frus1926v01#pg_614"><hi rendition="#italic">ibid</hi>., 1926, vol.
